{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here are two metal\ncylinders and a single drop of superglue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4004,
    "dDurationMs": 4671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once it sets, you can literally hang\nfrom that one drop of adhesive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9718,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh my God."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11970,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is crazy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14347,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how is superglue so strong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16683,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, that's what I want to find out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18518,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And along the way, we're going to learn\nhow it sets so quickly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22147,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why it's so good at sticking to skin,\nhow it saves lives,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26109,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how it might even help\nsolve our plastic pollution problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29863,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Plus, if it's so strong, one single"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32407,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "drop can easily lift over three tons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36369,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why is it weak in certain circumstances?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41249,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mom is going to kill us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42709,
    "dDurationMs": 709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*scream*"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43418,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1942, the US was at war."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46671,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to accelerate the production of gun\nsights, the Eastman Kodak Company"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50717,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was looking for a clear plastic\nthat could be cast"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53762,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead of grinding glass lenses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56598,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Chemist Harry Coover was working on\na compound called cyanoacrylate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60602,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It looked promising,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61853,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it had the unfortunate tendency\nto stick to everything it touched."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65899,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Coover called it a severe pain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68401,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as the war wound down,\nKodak gave up on finding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71654,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a plastic replacement and kept on making\ngun sights out of glass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76618,
    "dDurationMs": 1376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By 1951,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77994,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Coover was again trying to develop a clear plastic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81331,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This time for jet plane canopies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83958,
    "dDurationMs": 4755,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If he could just solve the stickiness\nproblem, cyanoacrylate could work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89964,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Coover showed the material to his coworker"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92258,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fred Joyner,\nbut gave him strict instructions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95261,
    "dDurationMs": 4505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I told him, look, don't take a refractive\nindex of this material."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99766,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you do, you're going\nto wreck the refractometer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102727,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cos it’s going to stick it together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104437,
    "dDurationMs": 5255,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But after testing 909\nother compounds, Joyner had forgotten."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109692,
    "dDurationMs": 5548,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he prepped the 910 test by smearing\ncyanoacrylate between two prisms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115240,
    "dDurationMs": 1376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After taking the measurement,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116616,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Joyner discovered\nhe couldn't pull the prisms apart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120286,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He panicked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121287,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The refractometer, worth nearly $10,000"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124374,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "adjusted for inflation, was ruined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128711,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But instead of getting angry,\nCoover had a flash of insight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132715,
    "dDurationMs": 3379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He got a sample of cyanoacrylate\nand began gluing together"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136094,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anything within reach. Glass\nplates, rubber stoppers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139764,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "metal spatulas, wood, paper, in all different combinations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144644,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He said “Everything stuck to everything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147522,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "almost instantly and with bonds\nI could not break apart.”"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151442,
    "dDurationMs": 4755,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With this discovery, he dubbed the compound Eastman 910 Adhesive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156197,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as it was the 910th substance\ntested in the company's search."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160451,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But nowadays,\neveryone calls this super glue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164330,
    "dDurationMs": 5548,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how does it work so quickly with\nsuch strength on so many different things?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169878,
    "dDurationMs": 1584,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bonds almost anything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171462,
    "dDurationMs": 751,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A plastic knob,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172213,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a plastic plug,  a rubber boot, a metal brooch,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173798,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a fishing rod, a cycle\ngrip, model planes and model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175842,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trains, a doorknob screw,\na flashlight case,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177635,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the broken trim on any car."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178803,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Super glue in the tube is a liquid of\nidentical monomer molecules."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182765,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The molecule is ethyl cyanoacrylate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186102,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you put it between two surfaces,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187937,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the liquid flows\ninto all the pores and crevices."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191274,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then the monomers\nstart reacting with each other,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194027,
    "dDurationMs": 3044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "joining to form long polymer chains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197071,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This turns the glue from a liquid into a solid,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200658,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and at this point it can no longer be\npulled out of the cracks and crevices,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204579,
    "dDurationMs": 4921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it's stuck in place\nand the two surfaces are connected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209500,
    "dDurationMs": 2712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you're ever trying to glue surfaces\nthat are too smooth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212212,
    "dDurationMs": 3169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is probably the reason\nsuper glue sticks poorly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215381,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are few crevices or pores for it\nto cling to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218676,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To fix this, you can sand the surfaces\nto introduce some surface texture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222972,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That way when the liquid glue solidifies,\nit's stuck in the cracks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228144,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what triggers the monomers to solidify"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231147,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead of staying liquid\nlike they are in the tube?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235568,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, ethyl cyanoacrylate is primed to react"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238446,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it has two double bonds\nand one triple bond close together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243368,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What makes it\nso reactive is you have a double bond"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245912,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "attached to a nitrile group\nand an ester group."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249582,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the unique part about\nthat is the chemistry of those groups"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252585,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that make that double bond so electron deficient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255338,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The oxygen and the nitrogen atoms\nattract electrons more than the carbons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260260,
    "dDurationMs": 4629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that leaves this carbon\nslightly positively charged."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264889,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is hungry. It is looking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266516,
    "dDurationMs": 709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And anything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267225,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even slightly electronegative,\nit will attack and it'll start a reaction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271646,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the presence of a negative ion,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273273,
    "dDurationMs": 4212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the carbon double bond breaks\nand four single bonds form."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277485,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the nitrile and ester\ngroups are so electronegative they pull"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281364,
    "dDurationMs": 6048,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the extra electron on across the molecule,\nmaking this carbon negative. That invites"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287412,
    "dDurationMs": 4337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "another slightly positive carbon\non a separate monomer to attack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291749,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now they're chemically linked\ntogether."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294585,
    "dDurationMs": 2128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The start of a polymer chain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296713,
    "dDurationMs": 3753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And once that goes\nnow it has the ability to go react"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300466,
    "dDurationMs": 4630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with all those other super glue\nhungry monomers and rapidly polymerize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305096,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a really, really chemically reactive\nspecies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308349,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That single initiator\nstarted a chain reaction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312103,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next monomer again"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313271,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pulls across the electron\nand more and more monomers bond together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317150,
    "dDurationMs": 5046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "forming longer and longer chains\nuntil the super glue has solidified."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323781,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It normally takes between\n10 and 30 seconds to set."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327118,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was much faster than other adhesives\navailable in the 1950s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331205,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A lot of glues like white\nglue and glue sticks work by drying out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335376,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you have to wait for the water\nto evaporate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340548,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But with super glue it's\nalmost the opposite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343509,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While I was prototyping snatoms, I 3D"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346304,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "printed these plastic shells\nand super glued them together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349557,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One day I was trying to open a bottle of\nsuper glue where the cap had gotten"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353394,
    "dDurationMs": 4088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "glued on to the nozzle,\nso I tried twisting it off with my teeth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357482,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the bottle exploded,\nfilling my mouth with super glue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361194,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was thinking, well,\nI might have a few seconds to spit it out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364781,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the saliva in my mouth before it set."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367158,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the super glue actually hardened\nimmediately."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369994,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It stuck to my teeth and my tongue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372372,
    "dDurationMs": 4629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had to get my now wife to pick it\nout of my teeth with tweezers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377001,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Luckily, it didn't glue together\nanything essential."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379670,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's\nbecause it solidified so rapidly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382673,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the reason it did\nthat is because the polymerization"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385426,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of super glue\nis actually triggered by water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388679,
    "dDurationMs": 4505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Specifically, it's the slightly negative\noxygen atoms in the polar water molecule"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393184,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the negative hydroxide ions in water\nthat often break"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396896,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "open the carbon double bond,\ninitiating the formation of chains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400983,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And water is everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402902,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, there's moisture in the air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404612,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "little bits of water on most surfaces,\nor absorbed into materials like fabrics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409534,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's why super glue sets rapidly\non almost every surface."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413663,
    "dDurationMs": 4713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each water molecule can initiate\nthe formation of a polymer chain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418376,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a forensic technique\nthat uses super glue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420878,
    "dDurationMs": 3796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fumes to pull fingerprints\nfrom non-porous surfaces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424674,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you grab something,\nyour hand leaves behind moisture"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427844,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and oils that are perfect\nfor super glue to bind with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431264,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this also makes\nskin ideal to stick to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434517,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are a lot of wrinkles and pores\nfor super glue to seep into."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438396,
    "dDurationMs": 4379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Plus, the protein collagen has a number\nof negative regions that can initiate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442775,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the polymerization reaction\nand bond directly with a monomer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447029,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So your skin is the perfect sort\nof surface for super glue to stick to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451325,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's why it's so hard to get off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453744,
    "dDurationMs": 4964,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some of your molecules literally\nbecome part of the polymer chain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458708,
    "dDurationMs": 4546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a medical case study where someone\ngot cyanoacrylate all over his hands."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463254,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he quickly went to wash it off\nwith soap and water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466966,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that accelerated\nthe polymerization reaction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469635,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and his hands were stuck together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472805,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he went to multiple medical\nprofessionals, and he got terrible advice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477727,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They tried alcohol, water and soap."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480646,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They also attempted physical separation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483399,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he went to consult cosmetic surgery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486152,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But finally someone suggested acetone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488863,
    "dDurationMs": 5756,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Acetone, or nail polish remover,\ndissolved the glue and released his hands."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494619,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, unfortunately,\nthe bottles for some types of super glue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497622,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "look incredibly similar\nto those for eyedrops."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500625,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there are hundreds of cases of people\nputting super glue directly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504545,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into their eyes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506005,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In that case, acetone is not the solution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508841,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't try to separate\nyour eyelids, just seek medical attention."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513429,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Super glue is strong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515681,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To demonstrate this and promote\nhis new product,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518768,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Coover went on a game show."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520978,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He showed that\nwith only a single drop of glue,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523356,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he could lift himself\nand the host into the air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526484,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here we go. One drop of glue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530947,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And after 24 hours,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532782,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it would support something\nlike 15,000 pounds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535868,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One drop of glue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537453,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, doctor,\nyou must be very proud of this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538996,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I imagine many years of research\nwent into its discovery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541290,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, as a matter of fact,\nit wasn't Gary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543876,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This discovery was purely by accident."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546796,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bully for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549006,
    "dDurationMs": 5589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Super glue polymers are almost all single chains running linearly between the surfaces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554595,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have a directionality to them,\nkind of like wood grain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558224,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The chains are densely packed\nwith some cross-linking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561352,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between them,\nand this makes the polymer fairly rigid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564689,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's about as hard as a hard hat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567400,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This makes it strong in compression.\nUnder tension,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570945,
    "dDurationMs": 4671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "super glue is strongest when you pull\nin the same direction as the chains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575616,
    "dDurationMs": 4213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The tensile strength of super glue\ncan be upwards of 25 mega pascals,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579829,
    "dDurationMs": 5088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is similar to other polymers,\nmeaning a square patch just five"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584917,
    "dDurationMs": 5839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "centimeters on a side could suspend a\nfully grown African elephant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590756,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But super glue also has its weaknesses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593384,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is brittle,\nso if there's a sudden impact,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596804,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it just kind of falls apart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599390,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a super glue is very quickly reacting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603436,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It usually produces really short polymer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606105,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "chains that have a matrix with built in stress."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609817,
    "dDurationMs": 5672,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Any time you have stress in a material,\nit's a potential failure point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615489,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thing that makes it a really good\nadhesive is kind of its Achilles heel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618451,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in some cases. Polyethylene,\npolypropylene,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622038,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nylons, like those squishy plastics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624832,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their polymer chains\nand their chemistry"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626834,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are such that they can absorb a lot of impact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628878,
    "dDurationMs": 4671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If a force comes\nin, they'll kind of deform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633549,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whereas in the chains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635468,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a super glue polymer,\nit doesn't have the ability to do that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638679,
    "dDurationMs": 6131,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So any impact will come and it'll\nphysically break those rigid bonds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644810,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it'll also kind of be absorbed\nin those stress points, and it'll cause"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648689,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the whole thing to fracture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652401,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Super glue is also\nweak if a force is applied perpendicular"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655613,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the polymer chains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657073,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is, it's weak in shear.\nDuring this shear test,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660910,
    "dDurationMs": 4546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the stress releases\nbreaking the super glue bond."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665456,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So shear is\nkind of a combination of forces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668626,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you kind of have like a compression\nand like a friction going on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672672,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tension is a pretty uni-directional force."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675341,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the polymer\nchains are able to deform enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679178,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, in shear you have a more dynamic\nset of forces going on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683140,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And and they're just kind of breaking up\nall at once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687311,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Shear force doesn't get spread evenly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689855,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's highest\nat the edges and lower in the middle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692942,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And since super glue is so brittle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694902,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it can't redistribute this stress,\ncausing the bond to fail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698989,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's even worse if you grab one\nend of a surface and try to peel it back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702993,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In that case,\nall that force is on a few polymers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706205,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the chains break one by one\nlike a zipper unzipping."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710376,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two long bars super glued together could be strong since there's a lot of surface area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715756,
    "dDurationMs": 4463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if one end breaks,\nthe rest can easily peel off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720219,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now a bond breaking is bad, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722346,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are some materials that super glue\nwon't even stick to at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726350,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here we have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728686,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a milk bottle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730312,
    "dDurationMs": 3379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is\nmade out of a plastic called polyethylene."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733691,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to put one drop right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737862,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it's so weak"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740322,
    "dDurationMs": 3838,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can see the glue has made a perfect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744160,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "little film"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746454,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it doesn't stick whatsoever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748956,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The materials\nthat super glue does not bond to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752376,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They fall in to category of materials\nthat are known as chemically inert."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756255,
    "dDurationMs": 959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And by inert"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757214,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it just means that\nthey don't have reactive sites."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760801,
    "dDurationMs": 5422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So super glue is so reactive\nbecause it is so electron deficient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766223,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's looking for any source of electrons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768517,
    "dDurationMs": 4630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you have a polypropylene\nor a polyethylene or a Teflon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773147,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And carbon loves carbon,\nand carbon is not sharing its electrons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777318,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's nothing on the surface\nthat is willing to donate any reactivity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782198,
    "dDurationMs": 4879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even if you add initiators, say,\nby spraying water, it still doesn't work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787077,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's because these materials\nare hydrophobic and non-porous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790664,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you spray like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792416,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a polypropylene sheet, with water\n it'll just fall off, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796170,
    "dDurationMs": 1084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, if you can think of, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797254,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the beating up of water\non a hydrophobic surface."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799965,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you pour super glue on top of water,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 803928,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it'll just like, you'll\njust get like a clump of super glue on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807181,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you can just peel it off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809892,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most super glue specifically warns against"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812019,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using it on polyethylene and polypropylene\nbecause it won't stick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816899,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this is actually a good thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818943,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to have something that super glue\nwon't stick to, so it can be contained"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823239,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and stored without setting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826242,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Super glue quickly found industrial applications."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 828911,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Its first sale was to Mason\nand Hanger in 1956,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832748,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who used it to assemble atomic bombs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836377,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Soon, different additives were devised\nto change the properties"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839588,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of pure ethyl cyanoacrylate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 841715,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The monomers by themselves are very runny,\nalmost like water,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845386,
    "dDurationMs": 5422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so companies added thickening agents\nlike fumed silica to turn it into a gel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850808,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fumed silica forms branched structures\nthat increase viscosity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854979,
    "dDurationMs": 5463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some acid is often added\nto inhibit polymerization in the tube."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860442,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you want to speed up the setting\nof super glue, one way is to add"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863737,
    "dDurationMs": 5089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more negative ions, the initiators\nthat start the polymerization reaction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868826,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can buy accelerators specifically\nfor this purpose off the shelf,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872580,
    "dDurationMs": 5505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but a number of DIYers and handymen\nuse baking soda - sodium bicarbonate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878085,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It reacts with moisture in the air\nto produce hydroxide ions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881714,
    "dDurationMs": 5547,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you add super glue, it sets even\nfaster due to all those ion initiators."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887261,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Plus, it forms a really hard\ncomposite substance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890764,
    "dDurationMs": 5381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can layer super glue and baking soda\nto strengthen a joint and fill gaps."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 896145,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It can even be drilled or sanded\nafter setting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899607,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's interesting\nto see how baking soda in solution"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 902985,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "speeds up the polymerization of super glue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905863,
    "dDurationMs": 1209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you take pure water"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907072,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and pour in super glue, you get a bunch\nof little plastic droplets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 911035,
    "dDurationMs": 4921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The glue sets quickly, but not fast enough\nto keep the whole stream connected. But"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915956,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with baking soda dissolved in the water,\nthe super glue sets even faster."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920836,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This creates a continuous\nlength of polymer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923380,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is really cool to see,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 925424,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the resulting plastic is fragile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 927760,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and can easily be crushed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931597,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you wanna glue things\nunderwater with superglue,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934391,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the key is actually to slow\nthe polymerization down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938145,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With a gel cyanoacrylate, the\nthickeners slow the reaction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942066,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "giving you enough time to\napply and detach objects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946028,
    "dDurationMs": 5339,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Wow, there it is: glued underwater."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951367,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not even a perfect fit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952785,
    "dDurationMs": 5797,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't put it together quite\nright, but it’s still stuck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958582,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- One day, Coover's eldest\nson was making a model,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961126,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when he accidentally cut his finger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963462,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a quick-thinking and\nexperimentally-minded father,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966465,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Coover got some super glue\nhe brought home from the lab"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969218,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and applied it to the cut."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971428,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It instantly sealed shut."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974056,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Coover immediately saw\nits potential in medicine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 977226,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he went to work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978686,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He envisioned a glue that could\ncompletely replace sutures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982398,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But his team soon ran\ninto three key problems:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985693,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, as super glue sets,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987736,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all those bonds forming release heat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990364,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is a standard cotton ball."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993200,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just gonna add some liquid super glue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996787,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "86. Oh my gosh, it's starting to smoke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000916,
    "dDurationMs": 5255,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "93, 99, 108."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006171,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whoo, made my eyes water. 120."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009466,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you do this at home, wear goggles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1011885,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and probably a respirator,\nand probably do it outside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015055,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm feeling it now. It\nis hot, hot to the touch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019226,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The cotton has a lot of surface area,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1021353,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's absorbed a lot of water,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023397,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the superglue sets\neven faster than usual"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026191,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and releases all its heat at once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028527,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I get it on my skin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029820,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the temperature increase\nwouldn't be as dramatic,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032156,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's enough to irritate a wound."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1035743,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second problem is that over time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037870,
    "dDurationMs": 2335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "super glue in the body breaks down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040205,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and some of the things it breaks down into"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042332,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are toxic chemicals like formaldehyde."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1045419,
    "dDurationMs": 4921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And finally, super glue is\nhard and brittle, unlike us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050340,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are mostly just squishy\nbags of meat and water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1053969,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So an adhesive for living\ntissue needs to be soft"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1057347,
    "dDurationMs": 4839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and flexible for the entire\nduration of the healing process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062186,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Remarkably, Coover and\nhis team found that all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1064855,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of these problems could be solved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066398,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a single change to the molecule:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069026,
    "dDurationMs": 4713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Simply increase the number of\ncarbons in the alkyl chain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073739,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With longer carbon\nchains, it takes more time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076450,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the monomers to bind together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1078243,
    "dDurationMs": 2545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which slows down the rate of reaction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1080788,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This slows the rate of heat released,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1082998,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so there's not a significant\ntemperature increase"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1085501,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all at once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086668,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The longer polymers also\nbreak down much more slowly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1089838,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the wound has enough time to heal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091924,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before the glue starts\nreleasing toxins into the body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1095177,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's removed before that happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1099264,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And finally, since the reaction is slower,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101558,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's more time for the\nmonomers to float around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1103894,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and form longer polymers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1105813,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These longer polymers\ncan absorb stress better"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1108649,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than shorter chains,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110109,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning the glue can flex\nmore without breaking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1113362,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With the main problems addressed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114988,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Coover submitted an\napplication to the FDA in 1964"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1118492,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for medical superglue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1121411,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The US military was very\ninterested in Coover's adhesive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124915,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they developed a\nmedical super glue spray"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1127042,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for use in the Vietnam War."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1130254,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The spray saved lives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132631,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In one case, a bullet hit\na 24-year-old soldier,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1135509,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "passing through his kidney and liver."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1138303,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After part of his liver was removed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140222,
    "dDurationMs": 2502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they gave him 12 liters of blood."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142724,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's enough to replace all the blood"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1144726,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in his body twice over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146603,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the bleeding just wouldn't stop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1148564,
    "dDurationMs": 2877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By conventional methods, he was gone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1151441,
    "dDurationMs": 2128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then the surgeons sprayed superglue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153569,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "directly on the liver."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155154,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bleeding stopped, vital\nsigns returned to normal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1157948,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the soldier recovered."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1160826,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Despite its success on the battlefield,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1162870,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "medical superglue was held\nup in bureaucratic red tape"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165789,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for years, so long that Coover\nhad to abandon the project."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1169793,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It wasn't until 1998 that he saw his dream"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1172588,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a medical glue approved:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1174631,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a 2-octyl cyanoacrylate called Dermabond."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1178302,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Medical super glue has now grown"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1180179,
    "dDurationMs": 5714,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be a $900-million-a-year industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186685,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the 74 years since\nCoover's accidental discovery,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1189813,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cyanoacrylate has grown to\nbecome a $3 billion industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194067,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But its impact doesn't stop there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1196403,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because now scientists are turning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198238,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to Coover's original research,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1199865,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exploring its use as a plastic,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1202159,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it could well solve one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1203702,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the biggest problems the planet faces:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1205913,
    "dDurationMs": 4671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how to recycle the mountain of\nplastic we produce each year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210584,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Manufacturers can shred, melt,\nand reform other plastics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1214838,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the polymers degrade,\nso the quality is worse"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1217466,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the process generates microplastics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1220052,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So you can only recycle mechanically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223138,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and thermally like that\na certain number of times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1225849,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before you get a material\nthat's kind of useless."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1228560,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It still will sit in the environment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1230145,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it won't break down,\nbut it's not useful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1232564,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] But superglue is unique."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234483,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you heat it up to 210 degrees Celsius,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1237361,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it'll break back down into pure monomers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1240864,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These can be distilled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1242491,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then reactivated\nback into fresh polymer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246203,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We have a starting material, we\nmake it into a plastic,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1248830,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then, under a certain stimulus,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1250916,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can turn it back to\nthat starting material."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1253377,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's see if we can\nmake a plastic from this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1256046,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, 'cause the goal\nof a depolymerizable plastic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1259216,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that it's sustainable, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1262052,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There are just two problems:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1264096,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, how do you cast something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1266306,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that sticks to basically everything?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1268850,
    "dDurationMs": 3129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And second, super glue\non its own is brittle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1271979,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so how do you stop it from breaking?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1274523,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The big problem is the handleability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1276984,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was kind of the original problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1279236,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They found that, okay,\nthis isn't a great plastic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1281655,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it sticks to everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1282906,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's how they discovered"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1284032,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it was an excellent adhesive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1285826,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we were faced with that same problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1288453,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But Coover didn't have the\nmodern plastics we have today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1292040,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Polypropylene, polyethylene,\nand Teflon are so inert,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1295210,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they don't activate superglue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1297337,
    "dDurationMs": 4213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they are the perfect\nmaterials to handle the monomers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1301550,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So we were able to actually handle it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1303385,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that was, you know, a huge check."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1305971,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can actually work with this material."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1308432,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Next, to reduce brittleness,\nyou need super glue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1311101,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to form long chains that tangle together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1314271,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this problem can actually\nbe broken down into two parts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1317941,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, a lot of initiators means lots"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1320444,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of short polymer chains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1322487,
    "dDurationMs": 3796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Second, as the superglue sets,\nthe existing chains freeze"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1326283,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they can't connect together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1327993,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There also might be some unused monomers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329995,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can't get into the\nright spot to attach."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1332914,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you can solve both these\nissues, you get longer chains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1337085,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first fix is to use a very weak base."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1340380,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By mixing in a little\nbit of this weak base,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1342966,
    "dDurationMs": 1251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are enough initiators"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1344217,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to start the polymerization\nreaction, but not too many,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1347637,
    "dDurationMs": 2837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the polymer chains end up being longer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1350474,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We use DMSO, dimethyl sulfoxide,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1352726,
    "dDurationMs": 6423,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which, in no other context,\nwould be used as an initiator,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1359149,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it was just electronegative\nenough that we were able"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362486,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to initiate a reaction\nthat could go slowly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1365113,
    "dDurationMs": 5631,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and proceed in a way that\nproduced a nice solid plastic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1370744,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Next, you need a\nsolvent, in this case, acetone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1374331,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And what a solvent is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1375457,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is it's just a medium that\ndilutes the conditions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1378835,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does not participate in the reaction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1381213,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Usually, it provides additional mobility."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1385300,
    "dDurationMs": 1001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] After mixing the glue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1386301,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and initiator into the acetone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1388261,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the mobile polymers are\nable to form even longer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1391223,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more stable chains than usual."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1394226,
    "dDurationMs": 2752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And after a while, all the superglue sets,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1396978,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the acetone evaporates, and\nthe new plastic is removed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1405404,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To reuse it, just heat it up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1407489,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and distill it to get\nback superglue monomers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1410575,
    "dDurationMs": 3546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So I would, on average, get around 93%,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1414121,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is excellent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415831,
    "dDurationMs": 875,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Compared to that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1416706,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even the most widely recycled plastics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1418792,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can't return to the same quality,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1420710,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they can only be\ndowncycled once or twice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423171,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before ending up in landfill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1425507,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I'm super glue's biggest fan, obviously,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1428260,
    "dDurationMs": 2752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I hope that it can\nactually have a real impact"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1431012,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in terms of sustainability"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1432180,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and kind of revolutionizing\nhow we look at plastics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1435392,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how we look at\nmaterials that, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1437394,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we've existed with for decades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1439229,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, okay, what if we\nuse this for something else?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1442232,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Coover said it took the right\nmindset to see cyanoacrylate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1445861,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a great adhesive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1447487,
    "dDurationMs": 1377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first time he worked with it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1448864,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he was thinking about gun sights\nand nothing but gun sights."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452534,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Its sticky qualities were a pain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1455287,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second time he encountered it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456830,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "his colleagues fixated on\nthe broken refractometer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1460625,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but he could finally see the quality"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1462794,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that frustrated him as a benefit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1465213,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then, after decades of\nresearchers only viewing it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1468091,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a useful adhesive, it took\nanother flash of inspiration"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1471219,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to see its potential\nas a plastic once more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1474306,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As Coover said, this should\nserve as a reminder to all of us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1477809,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be open-minded and curious enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1479895,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to pursue unexplained events\nand unexpected results,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483315,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which may unlock new secrets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1485358,
    "dDurationMs": 4255,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and lead to new and exciting\ndiscoveries of the future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1494117,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Coover's ability to look beyond roadblocks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1496203,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and see the breakthroughs\non the other side is a skill"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1498872,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that every great innovator shares."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1500999,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not some kind of rare genius,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1503418,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it just takes strong critical thinking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1505253,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and problem-solving skills,\nwhich anyone can learn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1508256,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you wanna start\nbuilding these skills yourself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1510550,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right now for free,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1511718,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "look no further than\ntoday's sponsor, Brilliant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1514513,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brilliant will help you build real skills"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1516473,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through thousands of interactive lessons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1518558,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on everything from math and science"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1520519,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to programming and technology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1522604,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On Brilliant, you don't\njust learn new topics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1524981,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you learn new ways of\nseeing the world around you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528109,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You'll be able to solve\nproblems like a scientist,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1530278,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "engineer, or data analyst."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1532030,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And since every lesson gets\nyou hands-on with key concepts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1535742,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'll know how to apply them\nto real-world situations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1539162,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I truly believe that learning\na little bit every day is one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1541831,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the most important things you can do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1543875,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you're like me\nand made a resolution"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1545877,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to end each day a little\nsmarter this year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1548255,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, Brilliant will\nhelp you actually do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1550882,
    "dDurationMs": 1669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All their lessons are bite-sized,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1552551,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can do them right on your phone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1554636,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So whenever you have a few minutes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1556304,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can be building a\nquicker, sharper mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1558932,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to try everything Brilliant\nhas to offer for free"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1561601,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a full 30 days, visit\nbrilliant.org/veritasium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1565355,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Click that link in the description"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1566940,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or scan this QR code right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1569276,
    "dDurationMs": 959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you sign up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1570235,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'll also get 20% off their\nannual premium subscription."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1573780,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I wanna thank Brilliant\nfor sponsoring this video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1576241,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I wanna thank you for watching."
    } ]
  } ]
}
